title: About me
---
body:

I am a software developer living in Germany.

You can find me on <a rel="me" href="https://mastodon.social/@do3cc">Mastodon</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/patrick-gerken/">LinkedIn</a> and <a href="https://github.com/do3cc">GitHub</a>. I am also on <a href="https://twitter.com/do3cc">twitter</a>, but I am not so active there.
